Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-13-2000||02:57 PM||||Im looking for a nice car cover. Ive seen them from $20.00 up to $300.00. Im going to store my car in the backyard for the winter. (so its going to be in harsh weather  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> ) Who here stores there Fiero outside & what kind of cover do you use? (Do you like it, Where did you get it, How much was it) I also saw the one in the Fiero Store book for $160.00. Is it any good? Can I get better quality for a cheaper price? If I have to pay more, thats fine. Im looking for the BEST cover to protect the car.<P><BR>TIA  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Carl<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">      <B>1985 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Standard||09-13-2000||03:17 PM||||I'm gonna be storing my GT outside this winter, too.. I don't want it to get any more rusty so I think I'm gonna get as much rust off as I can before the snow falls.  I need a good car cover too...<P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 150,000 miles and counting!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">    <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
Z||000002||Old Lar||09-13-2000||04:13 PM||||I use a water repellent cover I purchased from Pep Boys ~$120.  Then I cover (both cars) with one huge mother plastic tarp.  The car sits in the driveway covered most of the year except when I drive it.  I use bungee cords to hold everything down.  I use the holes in the lace wheels as the hold down point for the bungee cords. Winter winds are the biggest problem.<P>I've been doing this with my 87 for the last 10 years.  The only negatives are that the engine aluminum components get some oxidation over the winter.  Cleanup in the spring.  I rarely start the cars once the get covered.||||reg||1
